  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 17.94,
      "text": " More importantly, Studio AI identifies what's missing. Perhaps your pricing creates uncertainty, maybe your calls to action aren't compelling enough, or perhaps you're describing your venue beautifully but not addressing the questions and concerns couples are actually thinking about."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 19.24,
      "end": 26.3,
      "text": " Next, Studio AI creates an improved version, side by side, so you can instantly see the difference."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 27.5,
      "end": 32.4,
      "text": " Nothing is hidden. Every change is transparent and reviewable."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 33.46,
      "end": 43.66,
      "text": " The goal isn't to replace your voice, it's to strengthen it, making your brochure more persuasive, more engaging and more aligned with the couples you're trying to attract."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 45.28,
      "end": 55.5,
      "text": " Like what you see, approve it, need adjustments, request a revision or download the updated version and continue refining it with your team."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 56.76,
      "end": 59.72,
      "text": " Great venues deserve great brochures."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 60.94,
      "end": 69.28,
      "text": " Because when couples are comparing five or six venues online, the venue that communicates its value most clearly often wins."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 69.52,
      "end": 73.38,
      "text": " Not because it's cheaper, but because it's easier to say yes to."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
